hs\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The second analysis used medical examiner data to compare demographic and toxicologic characteristics\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 2\", \"q\": \"* Because of the low number of missing values for each of these variables, percentages for these were calculated for fentanyl deaths with known information.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"* p<0.05.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\", \"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}